              "content": "Calls any Tray connector operation to pull data from a particular third-party service. Used in combination with a user token and authentication ID to interact with service connector operations (e.g., list Salesforce objects, get Slack channels). Returns a promise that resolves to the output of the connector call. Requires a user token.",
